WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.700
[Music]

2
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.600
I, Steven, take you,
Kendall, to be my wife.

3
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.700
And these things I promise you: I will
be faithful to you and honest with you.

4
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.380
I will respect and trust,
help and care for you.

5
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.840
From this day forward,
wherever you go, I go.

6
00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.500
Whatever you face, I face.

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.660
In joy and in sorrow, in abundance
and in lack, in sickness and in health,

8
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.054
in every moment,
every season, I choose to love

9
00:00:31.054 --> 00:00:33.600
and cherish you for as
long as we both shall live.

10
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.400
Come on, Steve! Let's go!

11
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:43.500
[Whispering] I'm proud of you.
I'm so happy. I love you.

12
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.100
I, Kendall, take you,
Steven, to be my husband.

13
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.400
And these things I promise you: I will
be faithful to you and honest with you.

14
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.200
I will respect and trust,
help and care for you.

15
00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.840
From this day forward,
wherever you go, I go.

16
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.600
Whatever you face, I face.

17
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:03.900
In joy and in sorrow, and in abundance
and in lack, and in sickness and in health,

18
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.871
and in every moment and every
season, I choose to love

19
00:01:06.871 --> 00:01:09.400
and cherish you for as
long as we both shall live.

20
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.900
Oh, wow.

21
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.900
Beautiful.

22
00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.980
Kendall, I give you this ring as a sign
of my vow, and with all that I am

23
00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.882
and all that I have, I honor
you in the name of the Father,

24
00:01:40.882 --> 00:01:42.800
and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.

25
00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.004
Steven, I give you this
ring as a sign of my vow,

26
00:01:46.004 --> 00:01:47.920
and with all that I am
and all that I have,

27
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.800
I honor you in the name of the Father,
and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.

28
00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:55.100
Steven, you may kiss your bride.

29
00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.000
Please give it up, for the first time,

30
00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.200
Kendall and Steven!

31
00:02:04.400 --> 00:04:04.200
[Music]
